    comment "en" """
        Source W5012 SNOMED CT 242693000 = Hit/struck/kicked/bitten/scratched by another person, in
        institutional residence, while working. The activity qualifier (förvärvsarbete/paid work) is an
        ICD-10 external-cause surveillance detail with no separate SNOMED CT concept and does not change
        the clinical injury. Target SNOMED CT 4055396 (concept_code 242693000, standard_concept=S,
        Observation/Event domain). Best available standard concept: fully subsumes the
        hit/struck/kick/bite/scratch mechanism regardless of location or activity. Same target as parent
        W501. Moderate tier : mechanical Athena crosswalk pattern, unspecified-source external-cause
        code, not independently re-verified by a curated crosswalk.
        """
}
