    comment "en" """
        Source W5049 SNOMED CT 220859001 242693000 243671000000109 = Swedish ICD-10-SE extension of W50
        (hit/struck/kicked/bitten/scratched by another person) crossed with location [gata och vag
        (street/highway)] and activity [aktivitet, ospecificerad (unspecified activity)]. Target SNOMED CT
        44790611 (243671000000109) = -- Athena Maps-to crosswalk from W50 base (ICD10 concept_id
        45756301); captures the interpersonal-violence nature; broader because the Swedish code adds
        location+activity detail absent from the target. Target SNOMED CT 4055396 (242693000) = -- second
        Athena Maps-to target; broader still (any mechanical violence). Target SNOMED CT 40421837
        (220859001) = -- WHO ICD-10 location-axis cross-map mirrored in SNOMED CT; partial because it
        captures only the location axis and drops the activity axis. Confidence: 44790611 at (high) --
        crosswalk-verified and the only target that specifically captures interpersonal violence; one
        level broader. 4055396 at (moderate) -- crosswalk-verified but more general. 40421837 at (low)
        -- partial overlap (drops activity); ICD-10-derived [X] cross-map concept, not a native SNOMED CT
        clinical concept.
        """
}
